<h2>The Challenge</h2>

<div class="side-by-side">
  <p class="big">{{ subtitle }}</p>
  <p>
    In Queue was founded by esports veterans who were tired of commercial
    interests taking priority over competition. As a founding member, I led
    creative direction for our launch. The goal was to bring the esports
    community together around a new organization with veteran talent, a clear set of values, and a focus on competitive gaming.
  </p>
</div>
