<h2>The Solution</h2>
<div class="side-by-side">
  <p class="big">A Logo Based on Four Values</p>
  <p>
    We explored many directions before choosing a logo that was distinctive, ownable, and easy to animate. The final mark has four outward-facing arrows
    that represent our core values: Integrity, Community, Opportunity, and Excellence. Its emblem-style silhouette suits the esports space and also
    resembles a game queue.
  </p>
</div>
