<div class="side-by-side">
  <p class="big">A Reveal Video That Tells Our Story</p>
  <p>
    I directed a brand reveal video that presents our mission and values. The
    logo assembles piece by piece with animated typography and a pulsing sci-fi
    score, and the tension builds as it comes together. I made the piece in a
    few days using Blender's Eevee renderer and After Effects, and I added
    humorous audio samples that refer to fair play.
  </p>
</div>

